002700     05  FILLER                         PIC X(3).
002800     05  HEADER-LABEL                   PIC X(15).
002900     05  SEND-SEQ                       PIC X(4).
003000*----------  "Y" IF USED FOR LOADING DATABASE ONLY.  NO
003100*            TRANSACTIONS ARE CREATED.
003200     05  LOAD-SW                        PIC X.
003210     05  IN-TYPE                        PIC X.
003220     05  IN-DOCUMENT                    PIC X(12).
003230     05  IN-QUOTE-DOC REDEFINES IN-DOCUMENT.
003240         07  IN-QUOTE                   PIC X(6).
003250         07  FILLER                     PIC X(6).
003300     05  FILLER                         PIC X(97).
003400
